<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Albert Lin downgraded Motorola Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-5/8 to 49.</p>
</text>
